disableActionId.t.sol
└── when permission is not enabled
│   └── it should revert with PermissionIdNotEnabled
└── when permission is enabled
    ├── when action ID is not enabled for the permission
    │   └── it should complete without changes (no action to disable)
    └── when action ID is enabled for the permission
        ├── when action ID has policies
        │   └── it should remove all policies and action ID, emit ActionIdDisabled
        └── when action ID has no policies
            └── it should remove action ID and emit ActionIdDisabled